*.restore

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  DATOS GENERADOS POR EL FRAMEWORK — NO SON CÓDIGO
#  Contienen IPs, dominios, banners y credenciales de
#  sesiones reales. El remoto es público: nada de esto se
#  versiona. Si añades un directorio de salida nuevo, añádelo
#  también aquí.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Resultados de escaneo (convención actual: raíz del repo)
/scans/
CyberSecurity-Framework/scans/

# Árboles de datos del framework
CyberSecurity-Framework/loot/
CyberSecurity-Framework/captures/
CyberSecurity-Framework/dns/
CyberSecurity-Framework/fingerprinting/

# 06_PostExploitation y 07_Wireless: salidas junto al módulo
CyberSecurity-Framework/06_PostExploitation/loot/
CyberSecurity-Framework/06_PostExploitation/persistence/
CyberSecurity-Framework/07_Wireless/captures/

# 01_OSINT: dominios, subdominios, emails, metadatos y redes sociales
CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/domains/*.txt
CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/emails/*.txt
CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/emails/*.html
CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/emails/leaks/*.json
CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/metadata/*.txt
CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/social_media/*.txt
CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/subdomains/*
!CyberSecurity-Framework/01_OSINT/subdomains/README.md

# 02_Recon: un directorio por ejecución y sus volcados
CyberSecurity-Framework/02_Recon/recon_*/
CyberSecurity-Framework/02_Recon/dns/*
CyberSecurity-Framework/02_Recon/fingerprinting/*
CyberSecurity-Framework/02_Recon/host_discovery/*
CyberSecurity-Framework/02_Recon/whois/*
CyberSecurity-Framework/02_Recon/screenshots/*

# 04_Enumeration: los enumeradores dejan la salida junto a los scripts
CyberSecurity-Framework/04_Enumeration/*.txt
CyberSecurity-Framework/04_Enumeration/*/*.txt

# 08_Forensics: resultados del análisis
CyberSecurity-Framework/08_Forensics/analysis/
CyberSecurity-Framework/08_Forensics/recovered/

# 09_Automation: informes que genera report_generator.py
CyberSecurity-Framework/09_Automation/python/report.html
CyberSecurity-Framework/09_Automation/python/report.json

# 10_Evidence: pruebas, hallazgos y volcados
CyberSecurity-Framework/10_Evidence/proofs/
CyberSecurity-Framework/10_Evidence/findings/
CyberSecurity-Framework/10_Evidence/logs/
CyberSecurity-Framework/10_Evidence/pcaps/
CyberSecurity-Framework/10_Evidence/screenshots/
CyberSecurity-Framework/10_Evidence/credentials/found/
CyberSecurity-Framework/10_Evidence/*.zip

# 11_Reports: informes generados (las plantillas de templates/ se conservan)
CyberSecurity-Framework/11_Reports/final_report/*
!CyberSecurity-Framework/11_Reports/final_report/.gitkeep
CyberSecurity-Framework/11_Reports/evidence/*.tar.gz
CyberSecurity-Framework/11_Reports/report_*.json

# Payloads generados (la muestra php_shell.php se conserva)
CyberSecurity-Framework/05_Exploitation/payloads/web_shells/shell_*

# Objetivo de sesión del gestor
CyberSecurity-Framework/00_Config/.session

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Editores y sistema
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
